{
  "_metadata": {
    "synthetic": true,
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Disease progression parameters for longitudinal synthetic data generation. Models: linear_decline (Y(t) = Y(0) + beta*t + eps), episodic (relapse/remission cycles), stable_with_events (baseline with stochastic episodes). Annual rates are population means; individual rates sampled as rate_i ~ N(rate, std).",
    "citation_note": "Progression rates approximated from published natural history studies and clinical trial placebo arms. AD: Mendiondo 2000, Doody 2001; PD: Holden 2018; MDD: Solomon 2000; ALS: Chiò 2009; MS: Scalfari 2010; EP: Kwan 2000; HD: Tabrizi 2009."
